<div id="pipelineWorkerMonitorEvidence" class="pipeline-worker-evidence pipeline-execution-facts"><p class="pipeline-muted">Request identity and progress are not yet observed.</p></div>
<p id="pipelineWorkerMonitorNote" class="pipeline-worker-note">Heartbeat, useful progress, stop acknowledgement and native resource release are separate evidence.</p>
<div class="pipeline-worker-actions">
  <a id="pipelineWorkerMonitorDossier" class="pipeline-btn compact" hidden>Open task dossier</a>
  <button id="pipelineTeamLaunchStop" class="pipeline-btn compact" type="button" hidden disabled>Stop this exact worker</button>
  <button id="pipelineNativeSessionButton" class="pipeline-btn compact" type="button" hidden>Voir la conversation OpenCode</button>
</div>
<dialog id="pipelineNativeSessionDialog" class="pipeline-native-session" aria-labelledby="pipelineNativeSessionTitle">
  <div class="pipeline-worker-actions">
    <h3 id="pipelineNativeSessionTitle">Conversation OpenCode</h3>
    <button id="pipelineNativeSessionClose" class="pipeline-btn compact" type="button">Fermer</button>
  </div>
  <p>Lecture du journal natif du worker. Observer ne lance aucun modèle. La reprise crée un dépôt et une conversation indépendants après la fin de cette invocation.</p>
  <label>Invocation <select id="pipelineNativeSessionSelect"></select></label>
  <p id="pipelineNativeSessionStatus" role="status"></p>
  <div class="pipeline-worker-actions">
    <button id="pipelineNativeSessionHandoff" class="pipeline-btn compact" type="button" disabled>Reprendre dans une copie indépendante</button>
    <a id="pipelineNativeSessionOpen" class="pipeline-btn compact" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" hidden>Ouvrir la copie dans OpenCode ↗</a>
  </div>
  <div id="pipelineNativeSessionMessages"></div>
  <button id="pipelineNativeSessionMore" class="pipeline-btn compact" type="button" hidden>Messages suivants</button>
</dialog>
